      "writtenOn": "2025-08-14T13:28:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this correct? I see that the secure entry point includes `core_linear_id`, which seems relevant for the first time a core boots especially, though I\u0027m not familiar with the secure world boot protocol.",
      "revId": "8d46a09e7bb306889ddf16fdc69fdac8f5f327c5",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
