    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8648058a_e7cfd693",
        "filename": "src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000160
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-15T17:03:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve talked to the maintainers and this is the info I got:\n\n\u003e On the secondary core, hafnium does not expect anything to be passed by earlier bootloader:\n\u003e https://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/hafnium/hafnium/+/refs/tags/v2.13/src/arch/aarch64/hypervisor/hypervisor_entry.S#138\n\u003e\n\u003e On primary core, it expects the pointer to SPMC manifest fdt\n\u003e https://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/hafnium/hafnium/+/refs/tags/v2.13/src/arch/aarch64/hypervisor/hypervisor_entry.S#51\n\nIIRC the arguments we use now on the primary core were indeed required once, but it looks like not anymore. I\u0027ll add a separate patch to update that.",
      "parentUuid": "10d2a6c6_533b8d20",
      "revId": "8d46a09e7bb306889ddf16fdc69fdac8f5f327c5",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "18c8a14b_adc7a067",
        "filename": "src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000228
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-25T14:30:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I recall correctly, there was an ask from TEE vendors to pass the core linear id to help early startup code to setup a stack before C environment is ready.\n\nIn the SPMD:\nhttps://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/TF-A/trusted-firmware-a/+/refs/heads/master/services/std_svc/spmd/spmd_main.c#582\n\nhttps://hafnium.readthedocs.io/en/latest/secure-partition-manager/secure-partition-manager.html#spmc-boot\n\n\nFollowing a similar logic, with secure virtualization, Hafnium passes the vCPU id to the S-EL1 SP:\nhttps://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/hafnium/hafnium/+/refs/heads/master/src/arch/aarch64/plat/psci/spmc.c#156\nhttps://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/hafnium/hafnium/+/refs/heads/master/src/vcpu.c#200",
      "parentUuid": "8648058a_e7cfd693",
      "revId": "8d46a09e7bb306889ddf16fdc69fdac8f5f327c5",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0f3324ef_9aefcb49",
        "filename": "src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000160
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-25T14:40:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes it\u0027s still present in TF-A, but it seems to be unused in Hafnium. Does the documentation need an update?\n\nAlso...\n\u003e TF-A implementation defined behavior helping a legacy TOS migration to adopt FF-A\n\n... this doesn\u0027t sound like something we should care about in RF-A?",
      "parentUuid": "18c8a14b_adc7a067",
      "revId": "8d46a09e7bb306889ddf16fdc69fdac8f5f327c5",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d3911ef4_4537145d",
        "filename": "src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000228
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-25T14:51:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Yes it\u0027s still present in TF-A, but it seems to be unused in Hafnium\n\nI believe this was mostly for configs without secure virtualisation e.g. S-EL1 SPMC.\nMoving forward same TEE would be migrated under Hafnium seamlessly as latter provides same info through x4 at the SPMC/SP boundary\n\n\u003e this doesn\u0027t sound like something we should care about in RF-A?\n\nYes this looks an impdef legacy thing we might want to drop, however when secure virtualisation is used the boot protocol between SPMD/SPMC and SPMC/SP would then differ slightly.\nNote also the usage in tf-a-tests test partitions that will have to be amended:\nhttps://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/TF-A/tf-a-tests/+/refs/heads/master/spm/cactus/aarch64/cactus_entrypoint.S#47",
      "parentUuid": "0f3324ef_9aefcb49",
      "revId": "8d46a09e7bb306889ddf16fdc69fdac8f5f327c5",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
